                            {
                                "example_id": "aea6fe39-0b2d-4a18-aa9a-1f764ef80d1b",
                                "sense_id": "1b14d1b1-a368-3f7b-a3f5-71d4c9750d29",
                                "text": "So blyth was he , and fou ' of pawks; -- But yet he's dead!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73975f27-0b04-4c56-a41b-66f7c9589787",
                                "sense_id": "1b14d1b1-a368-3f7b-a3f5-71d4c9750d29",
                                "text": "and a laird May find a beggar sae prepar'd, Wi pawks and wiles, whar pith is wantin, As soon will mak him rue his tauntin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b60e2ede-5a6a-4e27-9902-ab082bb085c6",
                                "sense_id": "1b14d1b1-a368-3f7b-a3f5-71d4c9750d29",
                                "text": "I guess, that yours has no the art To win about a husband's heart, Nor kens the gate wi' saftening sound, And pawks, to bring ilk project round."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
